From aec5f5ab95cf0fb3d15dd561b9fff9f1a10461a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jared Massie <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 17:02:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add strict adult-content DNS filter setting

Adds an opt-in Settings toggle that routes allowed DNS queries through
CleanBrowsing's Family Filter resolver instead of 8.8.8.8, blocking
porn/adult sites automatically without a manual domain list. Turning it
on applies immediately (tightening); turning it off goes through the
same first-partner-approval flow as removing a blocked site.
---
